cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "APS-RAG: Corrective Agentic Graph-RAG"
abstract: >-
  A retrieval-augmented generation system combining hybrid retrieval
  (dense vectors + BM25 + a knowledge graph), cross-encoder reranking with a
  graph-proximity signal, query enhancement, and an agentic corrective
  generation loop.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
